<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thoughts & Reflections - Zhouqiao (Bridge) Zhao</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg">
    <style>
        /* Professional Academic Styling */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: #fff;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        /* Dark Mode */
        body.dark-mode {
            color: #e0e0e0;
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .header {
            border-bottom-color: #333;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .name {
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .title {
            color: #aaa;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .nav a {
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .nav a:hover, body.dark-mode .nav a.active {
            background: #333;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .section-title {
            color: #fff;
            border-bottom-color: #64b5f6;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .thought-card {
            background: #2a2a2a;
            border-color: #333;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .thought-card h3 {
            color: #fff;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .thought-card p {
            color: #ccc;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .coming-soon {
            background: #2a2a2a;
            border-color: #333;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode footer {
            border-top-color: #333;
            color: #888;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }
        
        /* Header */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        
        .name {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        /* Fixed Controls */
        .fixed-controls {
            position: fixed;
            top: 2rem;
            right: 2rem;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        
        .nav-link, .theme-toggle {
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        .nav-link:hover, .theme-toggle:hover {
            background: #2980b9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.4);
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .nav-link, body.dark-mode .theme-toggle {
            background: #64b5f6;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .nav-link:hover, body.dark-mode .theme-toggle:hover {
            background: #42a5f5;
        }
        
        /* Navigation */
        .nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        
        body.dark-mode .nav {
            background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.95);
            border-bottom-color: #333;
        }
        
        .nav a {
            color: #2c3e50;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .nav a:hover, .nav a.active {
            background: #ecf0f1;
        }
        
        /* Sections */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .thought-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .thought-card {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .thought-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .thought-card h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        
        .thought-card p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .thought-date {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        
        .coming-soon {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border: 2px dashed #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        .coming-soon h3 {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .coming-soon p {
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
            
            .fixed-controls {
                top: 1rem;
                right: 1rem;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .name {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .thought-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Fixed Controls -->
    <div class="fixed-controls">
        <button class="theme-toggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" id="theme-toggle">🌙 Dark</button>
        <a href="/blog" class="nav-link">📝 Back to Portfolio</a>
        <a href="/game" class="nav-link">🎮 Interactive Digital Twin</a>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="header">
            <h1 class="name">Thoughts & Reflections</h1>
            <p class="title">Non-academic musings on technology, creativity, and life</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Navigation -->
        <nav class="nav">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="/blog">Portfolio Home</a>
                <a href="/music">Music</a>
                <a href="/gallery">Gallery</a>
                <a href="/thoughts" class="active">Thoughts</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Thoughts Content -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Recent Reflections</h2>
            
            <!-- Sample thought posts - these will be replaced with dynamic markdown content -->
            <div class="thought-grid">
                <div class="thought-card">
                    <h3>🤖 The Creativity of Constraints</h3>
                    <p>In both music composition and research, I've found that constraints often spark the most creative solutions. Whether it's the limitations of an 8-bit sound chip or the boundaries of a research hypothesis, working within defined parameters forces innovative thinking...</p>
                    <p class="thought-date">August 2025</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="thought-card">
                    <h3>🌉 Building Bridges Between Worlds</h3>
                    <p>My nickname "Bridge" isn't just a translation of my name - it represents my approach to connecting seemingly disparate fields. Every project becomes an opportunity to find unexpected connections between AI, transportation, music, and visual art...</p>
                    <p class="thought-date">July 2025</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="thought-card">
                    <h3>📸 The Science of Seeing</h3>
                    <p>Photography and research share more than I initially realized. Both require careful observation, patience, and the ability to notice patterns that others might miss. Each captured moment is like a successful experiment - a hypothesis about beauty confirmed...</p>
                    <p class="thought-date">June 2025</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Coming Soon Section -->
            <div class="coming-soon">
                <h3>🚧 Dynamic Content Coming Soon</h3>
                <p>This section will be enhanced with a markdown-based content management system, allowing for easy addition of new thoughts and reflections. The system will automatically render markdown files from a content directory, complete with metadata support for dates, tags, and categories.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Stay tuned for more frequent updates and deeper reflections on the intersection of technology, creativity, and academic life!</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #999; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <p>© 2025 Zhouqiao (Bridge) Zhao • <a href="/blog" style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;">Portfolio Home</a></p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Theme Toggle - Enhanced with error handling
        window.toggleTheme = function() {
            try {
                document.body.classList.toggle('dark-mode');
                const isDark = document.body.classList.contains('dark-mode');
                const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
                if (toggleBtn) {
                    toggleBtn.textContent = isDark ? '☀️ Light' : '🌙 Dark';
                }
                localStorage.setItem('theme', isDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
            } catch (error) {
                console.error('Theme toggle error:', error);
            }
        };

        // Load saved theme
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            try {
                const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');
                if (savedTheme === 'dark') {
                    document.body.classList.add('dark-mode');
                    const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
                    if (toggleBtn) {
                        toggleBtn.textContent = '☀️ Light';
                    }
                }
            } catch (error) {
                console.error('Theme loading error:', error);
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>